[h2]Build 0.9.49[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Factory fumes[/b] (Vanilla Furniture Expanded - Factory): the dirty factory machines now give off toxic gas while they work, plus a little ground pollution - automated smelter, alloy forge, biofuel refinery, neutroamine synthesizer, ammunition press and medicine granulator. The conveyor crematorium adds a cloud of rot stink.
[*]They connect to the exhaust network: run exhaust pipe from them to a powered exhaust port to send the fumes outside. Unpiped, the fumes come out around the machine.
[*]Clean machines (autoloom, masonry saw, mincer, conveyor oven, assembler, distillery, machining bay) make no fumes.
[*]New setting to switch factory fumes off. The pollution slider scales them too.
[/list]
